  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Only one Pokémon can Stroll with you\n",
        "in a Pokéwalker...\r",
        "I can’t decide which one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I may not look like it, but I have\n",
        "many Pokéwalkers on me!\f",
        "They make loud noises as I walk.\r",
        "Maybe taking a Stroll isn’t as easy as\n",
        "I thought..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Pay attention, please!\r",
        "...Oops, I have to quit thinking like\n",
        "a teacher all the time.\r",
        "You must be a Pokémon Trainer.\r",
        "Since you’re working so hard,\n",
        "I want you to have this.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00003",
      "garbage": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Let a Pokémon hold that Quick Claw.\r",
        "Sometimes it will strike first\n",
        "during battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s fun having a Pokémon out of its\n",
        "Poké Ball to walk with it,\f",
        "but the Pokéwalker is a whole\f",
        "new dimension."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "My mom can’t take my Pokémon and tells\n",
        "me not to play with it indoors.\f",
        "But, hey!\r",
        "I can keep it in my Pokéwalker.\n",
        "That way, I’m always with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I take walks in the park, but I\n",
        "never go into the grass.\r",
        "Trainers always want to battle..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00008",
      "en_US": "PERSIAN: Fufushaa!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Huff, puff, huff...\r",
        "I am...out of...breath!\n",
        "I’ve been running to try\f",
        "and charge the Pokéwalker!"
      ]
    },
